        "original_id": "ffa6c669-5426-5e0b-abd5-a96c142491ff",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Huai'an, Qian'an, Qing Yan Garden, Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County\n- Places: Jiangsu Province, Hebei Province, Eastern China, North China, Liaoning, Qinhuangdao, Lingyuan, Jianchang County, Suizhong County, Lulong County, Kuancheng Manchu Autonomous County, Qianxi County\n\nFacts:\n- Huai'an was formerly called Huaiyin until 2001.\n- Huai'an is a prefecture-level city in central Jiangsu Province in Eastern China.\n- Qian'an is a city in the northeastern part of Hebei Province in North China.\n- Qing Yan Garden is located in Huai'an City, Jiangsu Province, China.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Lingyuan and Jianchang County in Liaoning to the north.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Suizhong County in Liaoning and Qinhuangdao city proper to the east.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Qian'an and Lulong County to the south.\n- Qinglong Manchu Autonomous County borders Kuancheng Manchu Autonomous County and Qianxi County to the west.",
